<otsl><loc_53><loc_97><loc_470><loc_201><ched>Crop<ched>Yield (tons)<ched>N<ched>P<ched>K<ched>Ca<ched>Mg<ched>S<ched>Cu<ched>Mn<ched>Zn<nl><ecel><ecel><ecel><ecel><ched>----------------------pounds per acre ----------------------<lcel><lcel><lcel><lcel><lcel><lcel><nl><rhed>Alfalfa<fcel>6<fcel>350<fcel>40<fcel>300<fcel>160<fcel>40<fcel>44<fcel>0.10<fcel>0.64<fcel>0.62<nl><rhed>Bluegrass<fcel>2<fcel>60<fcel>12<fcel>55<fcel>16<fcel>7<fcel>5<fcel>0.02<fcel>0.30<fcel>0.08<nl><rhed>Coastal Bermuda-grass<fcel>8<fcel>400<fcel>45<fcel>310<fcel>48<fcel>32<fcel>32<fcel>0.02<fcel>0.64<fcel>0.48<nl><rhed>Fescue<fcel>3.5<fcel>135<fcel>18<fcel>160<fcel>-<fcel>13<fcel>20<fcel>-<fcel>-<fcel>-<nl><rhed>Orchard Grass<fcel>6<fcel>300<fcel>50<fcel>320<fcel>-<fcel>25<fcel>35<fcel>-<fcel>-<fcel>-<nl><rhed>Red Clover<fcel>2.5<fcel>100<fcel>13<fcel>90<fcel>69<fcel>17<fcel>7<fcel>0.04<fcel>0.54<fcel>0.36<nl><rhed>Soybean<fcel>2<fcel>90<fcel>12<fcel>40<fcel>40<fcel>18<fcel>10<fcel>0.04<fcel>0.46<fcel>0.15<nl><rhed>Timothy<fcel>4<fcel>150<fcel>24<fcel>190<fcel>18<fcel>6<fcel>5<fcel>0.03<fcel>0.31<fcel>0.20<nl><caption><loc_54><loc_248><loc_103><loc_253>Table 503-14</caption></otsl>
