<text><loc_248><loc_460><loc_405><loc_464>2/   Residue cover was removed for research purposes.</text>
<page_footer><loc_30><loc_476><loc_50><loc_481>504-14</page_footer>
<page_footer><loc_184><loc_476><loc_291><loc_481>(190-V-NAM, 4th Ed, February 2011)</page_footer>
