<page_footer><loc_209><loc_476><loc_316><loc_481>(190-V-NAM, 4th Ed, February 2011)</page_footer>
<page_footer><loc_451><loc_476><loc_470><loc_481>504-25</page_footer>
<page_break>
<page_header><loc_30><loc_33><loc_57><loc_37>Part 504</page_header>
<page_header><loc_314><loc_33><loc_350><loc_51>National Agronomy Manual</page_header>
<text><loc_172><loc_33><loc_234><loc_37>Water Management</text>
<unordered_list><list_item><loc_30><loc_78><loc_226><loc_91>California Fertilizer Association. 1985. Western fertilizer handbook. Seventh edition. Sacramento, CA.</list_item>
<list_item><loc_30><loc_101><loc_229><loc_129>Department of Primary Industries. 2010. Soil structure. Victorian Resources Online, Canada. http://www. dpi.vic.gov.au/dpi/vro/vrosite.nsf/pages/soil-health_soil_structure .</list_item>
